WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.775
Draw every force on one object, then add them up direction by direction.

2
00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:09.954
Every force acting on the sled, drawn as arrows from the sled.

3
00:00:10.756 --> 00:00:13.931
Up and down, the weight and the snow's push balance.

4
00:00:14.707 --> 00:00:18.532
Across, sixty against forty: a net twenty newtons forward.

5
00:00:20.593 --> 00:00:23.718
Pull with forty newtons: balanced both ways.
